BnRg&oe=6AFF2625"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Skillup_Landscape.png", "id": "348096568245352", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75451778_348096574912018_3005572446759952788_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qxRsw2JASsYQ7kNvwFgtxrQ&_nc_oc=Adrm-SZ0HmbKgLKUjY71DcMmOk0w5ckdnCR8k9f3q6qvhXVsxRLthErblLM8dKtJGbw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQaAA4jWCh2VQfWVTdvHKlfHYtFU_sHDQLOrCDSce0czQ&oe=6AFF0AAE"}, "display_name": "Skillup VR NurseSIM", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Skillup VR NurseSIM is designed for junior healthcare professionals to practice their basic nursing skills. Developed together with a Norwegian vocational institution, the simulation pack offers multiple scenarios set in both clinical and home environments, for users to familarize themselves with ABCDE-assessment, the NEWS2 scoring system and ISBAR communication techniques.\n\n- 8 training scenarios of different patient profiles\n- Multiplayer setup\n- English and Norwegian language options\n- Intuitive, interactive and wireless\n- Compatible with Meta Quest 2 and 3\n- NEWS2 Scoring System \n- ISBAR Communication Framework\n- Facilitator control, communication and supervision capability *\n\n* Add-on application.", "short_description": "Skillup VR NurseSIM is designed for junior healthcare professionals to practice their basic nursing skills. Developed together with a Norwegian vocational institution, the simulation pack offers multiple scenarios set in both clinical and home environments, for users to familarize themselves with ABCDE-assessment, the NEWS2 scoring system and ISBAR communication techniques."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://skillupvr.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Skillup AS", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://skillupvr.com/", "category": nul